Rule 126 (All the elements from Tuple are present in one of Tensor dimension's shape when tensor is an Integer.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 6 then ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : ∃j ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : v_2[i] = shape(v_1, j)
